            "answer": "$$P(A\\cap B)=P(A)+P(B)-P(A\\cup B)=${MMmath.round((:A)/100,2)}+${MMmath.round((:B)/100,2)}-${MMmath.round((:U)/100,2)}=\\color{red}{${MMmath.round((:C)/100,2)}}$$",
            "value": [
                "${MMmath.round((:C)/100,2)}",
