            "question": "Es gilt $$P(A)=${MMmath.round((:A)/100,2)}$$ und $$P(A\\cap B)=${MMmath.round((:C)/100,2)}$$. Berechne $$P(A\\cap\\overline{B})$$.",
            "answer": "$$P(A\\cap\\overline{B})=P(A)-P(A\\cap B)=${MMmath.round((:A)/100,2)}-${MMmath.round((:C)/100,2)}=\\color{red}{${MMmath.round((:A-:C)/100,2)}}$$",
            "value": [
