        {
            "name": "Weder A noch B",
            "vars": {
                "c": "1_4",
                "x": "1_7",
                "y": "1_7",
                "C": "${5*:c}",
                "A": "${5*:c+5*:x}",
                "B": "${5*:c+5*:y}",
                "U": "${:A+:B-:C}"
            },
            "question": "Es gilt $$P(A)=${MMmath.round((:A)/100,2)}$$, $$P(B)=${MMmath.round((:B)/100,2)}$$ und $$P(A\\cap B)=${MMmath.round((:C)/100,2)}$$. Berechne $$P(\\overline{A}\\cap\\overline{B})$$.",
            "answer": "$$P(\\overline{A}\\cap\\overline{B})=1-P(A\\cup B)=1-(${MMmath.round((:A)/100,2)}+${MMmath.round((:B)/100,2)}-${MMmath.round((:C)/100,2)})=\\color{red}{${MMmath.round((100-:U)/100,2)}}$$",
            "value": [
