            "vars": {
                "ij": "0_7_2_^&",
                "o": "0_2",
                "z": "${(() => { const A = :ev[:ij[0]][1], B = :ev[:ij[1]][1]; return [1,2,3,4,5,6].filter(x => [A.includes(x) || B.includes(x), A.includes(x) && B.includes(x), A.includes(x) && !B.includes(x)][:o]).length; })()}",
                "M": "${(() => { const A = :ev[:ij[0]][1], B = :ev[:ij[1]][1]; return [1,2,3,4,5,6].filter(x => [A.includes(x) || B.includes(x), A.includes(x) && B.includes(x), A.includes(x) && !B.includes(x)][:o]).join(';\\,'); })()}"
            },
            "question": "Ein Würfel wird einmal geworfen. $$A$$: „Die Augenzahl ist ${:ev[:ij[0]][0]}“, $$B$$: „Die Augenzahl ist ${:ev[:ij[1]][0]}“. Berechne $$P(${['A\\cup B','A\\cap B','A\\cap\\overline{B}'][:o]})$$.",
            "shortq": "$$A$$: ${:ev[:ij[0]][0]}, $$B$$: ${:ev[:ij[1]][0]}; $$P(${['A\\cup B','A\\cap B','A\\cap\\overline{B}'][:o]})$$",
            "answer": "$$A=\\{${:ev[:ij[0]][1].join(';\\,')}\\}$$, $$B=\\{${:ev[:ij[1]][1].join(';\\,')}\\}$$<br>$$${['A\\cup B','A\\cap B','A\\cap\\overline{B}'][:o]}=${:z===0 ? '\\emptyset' : '\\{' + :M + '\\}'}$$, also $$P=\\dfrac{:z}{6}=\\color{red}{${MMmath.fractionSimplifiee(:z,6)}}$$",
